 on the lintel\nset glyphs weathered barely visible\ndrop in a butterfly above the monkey's head\nI wonder if the snake should actually show, tail only\ntell me where the explorer's path enters the scene\nmake the fallen column three chunks long\nset chunks stone ferns green\nline the roots up creeping down the wall\nthen soften the background into green haze\npleese make the cloumns of the colonnade mossy not clean\nwhere is the map marker in all this? the stone with the spiral\nshow what changed since the vines grew\ninstead of a monkey make it a toucan on the column\nset toucan black chest yellow beak huge\ncan you make the whole scene slightly cooler in tone\nthanks!\nnext undo the cool tone, keep everything else\nmake it: a whale tail far out, a sailboat nearer, a buoy rocking in the swell, and gannets diving\nset whale tail dark slate wet shine\ntell me how far out the whale is supposed to be\nmake the swell gentle, no whitecaps near the boat\nset sailboat tan sail white\nwhat if the buoy had a stripe\ndrop in a reflection line under the whale tail\nagain a shorter reflection this time\ncould you put the sun low behind the whale\npleese make the cloumns of light on the water shimmer\nset sun path gold on water\nI wonder if the gannets should be mid dive, folded\nthen add a distant headland on the right horizon\nset headland blue gray misty\nline the waves up so they all travel the same way\ninstead of gannets make them gulls\nshow what changed on the waterline\nnext add a small child's bucket on the shore, foreground\nset bucket red spade yellow\nwhere should the wet sand band end? blend it\nthat is everything, thanks!\nmove the whale tail right by 20 and make it smaller; then check it does not clash with the sailboat\nmkae the swell lines thinner toward the horizon\nset horizon line faint blue\nadd a village well with a bucket on a rope, a woman drawing water, ducks in a puddle, and laundry strung between cottages\nset well stone gray roof tiled\nhvae the woman brace against the rope\nCHUNK_EOF\nwc -l /home/salboaie/work/sopworlds/webmeet-dataset/imported/generated/generated-drawing.txt",
