      "display": {
        "summary": "bash: cat >> /home/salboaie/work/sopworlds/webmeet-dataset/imported/generated/generated-drawing.txt <<'CHUNK_EOF'\ndraw a pirate ship with three masts, sails partly furled, a flag with crossbones, and a rowboat trailing behind\nset sails cream patched brown\nmake the flag black with a white skull, small\ntell me where the bow wave starts so it looks like the ship is moving\nhvae the crew climb the rigging\ndrop in a parrot on the captain's shoulder\nset parrot red wings green\nwhat if the sea were rougher, swell higher\nthen add spray where the hull cuts the water\nagain no spray near the rowboat this time\ncould you make the horizon further away\npleese make the cloumns of the mainmast ratlines neater\nI wonder if the treasure island should show on the horizon\nmake the island tiny, maybe 20 across\nset island green bump sand rim\nline the cannon ports up along the hull\ninstead of cannon ports make them sealed\nshow what changed to the rigging\nnext add a spyglass in the captain's hand\nthanks, great!\nwhere is the anchor? hang it off the starboard bow\nset anchor iron gray chain links\nthat would help.\nmkae the deck planks lighter\nadd a robot walking a robot dog, both slightly clunky, down an empty street with one flickering lamp\nset robot brushed steel dome head amber\nmake the robot 60 tall and the dog 25 tall\nset robot dog copper riveted\nwhat if the lamp cast a pool of light around them\nthen lengthen the robot's shadow\nagain shorter shadow this time, lower sun\ntell me which way the shadows should fall for that lamp\ncould you put steam vents along the curb\nset steam pale gray drifting\ndrop in a cat watching from a window ledge\nI wonder if the windows should glow with television light\npleese make the cloumns of the shopfront even\nmake the street wet so the neon reflects\nset neon signs pink cyan buzzing\nline the rooftops up so they step down to the right\ninstead of a dead end put a bridge at the street's end\nshow what changed to the skyline\nnext a bicycle chained to the lamp post\nset bicycle teal frame black tires\nthanks!\nwhere does the alley go? suggest it with a hint of haze\nthat is the whole street done.\ndraw a space scene: a rocket mid burn, a planet ringed and tilted, a moon cratered, and stars dense in the lower left\nset rocket white fins red window round\nmake the exhaust plume flare out, widest at the back\nset plume orange core white\nwhat if the rocket banked slightly left\nthen add tiny thruster puffs from the side jets\nagain no bank this time, straight up\ntell me where the terminator line should fall on the planet\nset planet banded ochre cream\ncould you put a small satellite silhouette near the moon\ndrop in an astronaut tethered, drifting\nset astronaut suit white visor gold\nI wonder if the tether should curve toward the rocket\nmake the moon about 80 across\nset moon gray craters darker gray\npleese make the cloumns of stars denser near the corner\nline the ring particles up in a soft arc\ninstead of a ring make it two faint rings\nshow what changed in the corner star field\nnext put a tiny distant station, lights blinking\nset station lights blinking amber\nthanks, that is beautiful!\nwhere should the comet enter? top left feels right\nset comet ice blue tail long\nmkae the comet tail sweep more to the side\nadd a bakery window with loaves stacked, a baker dusted with flour, a queue of two customers, and a cat curled on a chair by the door\nset bakery window warm yellow glow\nmake the loaves golden, varied shapes\nset baker apron white sleeves rolled\nwhat if the queue were chatting, heads together\nthen a baguette under the baker's arm\nagain a round loaf this time not a baguette\ntell me which loaves are on the top shelf\ncould you add steam from a cooling rack\nset steam bread warm faint\ndrop in a bicycle with a bread basket outside\nI wonder if the awning should be striped green and cream\npleese make the cloumns of the doorframe straight\nmake the window display two shelves deep\nset shelves warm wood worn\nline the pastries up on the lower shelf\ninstead of pastries add iced buns with cherries\nshow what changed in the window\nnext a chalkboard menu leaning by the door\nset chalkboard black chalk white specials\nthanks, smells almost real!\nwhere is the till? put it on the counter at the left\nthat would help a lot, thanks!\nCHUNK_EOF\nwc -l /home/salboaie/work/sopworlds/webmeet-dataset/imported/generated/generated-drawing.txt",
