        "command": "cat >> /home/salboaie/work/sopworlds/webmeet-dataset/imported/generated/generated-diagram.txt <<'CHUNK_EOF'\nadd an ER diagram with Customer, Order, Product, and a junction table between Order and Product\nset tables white header bold\ncan you crow foot the relationship from Customer to Order\ntell me which table has the most columns\nwhat if the junction table sat between them vertically\nthen draw the cardinalities as tiny labels on both ends\nset cardinality labels 7 point gray\nagain no crow feet this time, plain arrows\npleese make the cloumns of each table the same width\nline the tables up in a diamond arrangement\nI wonder if the PK fields should be underlined\nset PK underline bold\ndrop in an FK note on the Customer field of Order\nshow what changed since the junction was added\nnext shade every PK row very light yellow\nset PK shade 8 percent yellow\nmkae the column names left aligned, types right aligned\nwhere does the join path get thick? highlight Order to Product\ninstead of a diamond layout make it a clean left to right chain\nthanks, that is a proper schema!\nthat would help.\ndraw a sequence diagram: Client, Gateway, Service, DB across the top\nset lifelines dotted gray\ncan you make the first call a solid arrow and the reply a dashed one\nthen add an alt frame for the error case\nset alt frame pale blue label alt\nwhat if the error branch got a light red wash instead\nagain with a divider line between the branches\ndrop in an activation bar on the Service lifeline\nset activation bars navy slim\ntell me how many messages cross the Gateway lifeline\nline the message arrows up with a gap of 24\ninstead of slanted arrows keep them horizontal\nshow what changed to the alt frame\nnext add a loop box around the retry messages\nset loop label loop retry 3\npleese make the cloumns of the lifeline headers equal width\nhvae the DB reply arrive after a visible delay tick\nI wonder if a note should explain the timeout\nset note yellow corner folded\nmkae the arrows thinner so the diagram breathes\nwhere do the actor stick figures go? only on the far left\nset actor stick figures black small\nthanks, sequence reads fine now!\ncould you do a gantt with five tasks and one dependency chain\nset bars teal dependency arrows red\nmake the critical path stand out with a brighter stroke\nset critical path stroke orange 3pt\nwhat if the second task started a week earlier\nthen slide everything that depends on it earlier too\nagain leave the last task where it is\ntell me which task is longest in days\nhighest first: list tasks by duration in the notes\nset weekend stripes light gray\ndrop in a milestone diamond at the end of task four\nset milestone diamond navy bold\nline the task labels up flush right of the bars\ninstead of stripes shade only Sundays\nshow what changed after the reschedule\nnext add a today line like the timeline chart\nset today line dashed crimson\npleese make the cloumns of the date header match the bar grid\nI wonder if the labels can rotate to fit\nmkae the row height smaller, 18 is enough\nwhere does the legend for colors go? below the chart\nset legend below horizontal\nthanks, the plan is readable now!\nthat is all for this chart.\nbuild a pie chart from the invoice totals: hosting 40, people 35, tools 15, other 10\nset slice colors teal amber slate cream\ncan you pull the hosting slice slightly out\ntell me which slice is smallest\nwhat if the small slices were grouped as other, under 10\nthen label the slices outside with leader lines\nset leader lines thin gray\nagain no percentages inside this time\nline the labels up in a column at the right\ninstead of a pie make it a donut with a total in the hole\nset donut hole total bold centered\nshow what changed in the middle\nnext make the other slice a darker slate\nset other slice slate dark\npleese make the cloumns of the legend items line up\nI wonder if the total should include tax\nmkae the slice borders white 2pt\nwhere does the caption go? under the donut as usual\nset caption center italic\nthanks, tasty!\nscatter the latency points on a grid from 0 to 200 ms\nset points teal small round\ncan you add a trend line through the cloud of points\nthen shade the points above 150 light red\nset outlier shade 20 percent red\nwhat if the axis went to 250 to make room\nagain keep the ticks every 25 ms\ntell me where the median sits on the x axis\ndrop in an annotation at the outlier near 180\nset annotation arrow curved thin\nline the axis labels up flush against the ticks\ninstead of a trend line fit a smooth curve\nshow what changed to the point cloud\nnext add a second scatter in orange for the second region\nset region two points orange\npleese make the cloumns of the tooltip data neat\nI wonder if a rug along the bottom would help show density\nmkae the point sizes equal, no mapping to size\nwhere should the legend go? top right like before\nset legend top right frame none\nthanks, that tells the story!\ndraw a venn with two circles, overlap in the middle\nset circles blue orange translucent\ncan you label only the overlap shared\nwhat if a third circle joined from below\nthen keep only pairwise overlaps visible, no center patch\nset venn borders solid 2\nagain with the labels outside this time\ndrop in counts in each region\nset counts bold centered\ntell me how big the overlap region is\nline the two circles up so their centers are horizontal\ninstead of circles make them rounded boxes overlapping\nshow what changed to the middle region\nnext make the overlap hatch with fine lines\nset hatch diagonal 45 fine\npleese make the cloumns of the legend under the venn even\nI wonder if the labels should match the circle colors\nmkae the overlap slightly darker\nwhere does the caption sit? directly under, no gap\nthanks!\nthat would help.\nsketch a floor block plan: reception, two meeting rooms, kitchen, and a corridor connecting them all\nset rooms pale fills doors small arcs\ncan you make the corridor a straight spine with rooms hanging off it\ntell me which room has the biggest area\nwhat if the kitchen moved next to reception\nthen keep the corridor width at 30 units\nagain with the doors opening inward this time\ndrop in desks as small rectangles, four per room\nset desks gray 8 by 12\nline the desks up in pairs facing each other\ninstead of four desks put six in the big room\nshow what changed to the layout\nnext label each room with a lettered plate\nset room plates navy white text\npleese make the cloumns of the corridor straight\nI wonder if windows belong on the outer wall\nmkae the window marks short dashes on the top wall\nwhere does the north arrow go? corner, small\nset north arrow small top right\nthanks, I can read the plan now!\nhvae the sitemap show three levels under Home\nadd branches: about, blog, contact at level two\nset level two spread even gaps\ncan you collapse the blog branch for now\ntell me which page has the most children\nwhat if the links were curved like roots\nthen color external links red\nset external links red dashed\nagain no arrows on internal links this time\ndrop in a small legend for internal versus external\nset legend below left aligned\nline the level three pages up under their parents\ninstead of dots make each page a rounded rect\nshow what changed since the collapse\nnext expand the contact branch only\npleese make the cloumns of the tree tidy, they drift\nI wonder if the home node should be bigger\nmkae the connectors gentle elbows, not right angles\nwhere do breadcrumbs go? no, that is the page, not the chart\nthanks, saved me an hour!\nadd a value stream: request, triage, build, test, release\nset stages boxes pale blue\ncan you put the wait times as red gaps between stages\nthen total the wait time under the stream\nset wait gaps red hatched\nwhat if the build stage were two parallel lanes\nagain merge them back before test\ntell me which stage box is widest\nline the stage labels up inside the boxes\ninstead of boxes make them stadium shapes\nshow what changed to the gaps\nnext add a kaizen burst on the test stage\nset kaizen burst red jagged note\ndrop in a small clock icon next to each wait\nset clock icons gray tiny\npleese make the cloumns of stage widths proportional to duration\nI wonder if the release stage needs a gate diamond\nmkae the stream flow strictly left to right\nwhere does the customer sit? far left, round shape\nset customer shape round label user\nthanks, lean and clear!\nthat would help the team.\nhvae the circuit blocks show pin stubs on all sides\nconnect a Battery block to a Switch block to a Lamp block\nset wires black 2 orthogonal\ncan you route the wire from Switch around the label, not through it\ntell me which wire crosses another\nwhat if the lamp were drawn with a small glow when the switch is on\nthen toggle the switch and show both states side by side\nagain with state captions under each\ndrop in a ground symbol under the lamp\nset ground symbol black small\nline the blocks up in a single row first, then let me see it\ninstead of a lamp make it a buzzer\nshow what changed to the bottom rail\nnext tidy the wire lengths, all segments multiples of 5\nset wire segments snap 5\npleese make the cloumns of the pin labels tiny and gray\nI wonder if the battery needs a plus and minus marking\nmkae the junction dots solid black small\nwhere does the wire label current go? on the top wire\nset current label italic i\nthanks, sparks joy!\ncircle the node called Gate with a thin red ring\nface the arrows toward the decision always\nhead the diagram with the title System overview\nfoot the page with today's date, small and gray\ntop the tallest column with a star marker\ndrop in an aqualung next to the diver node so the metaphor is obvious\nset aqualung icon teal small\nhvae the Cluster group hug its children tightly\nletter the annexes A through D down the right margin\nnumber the steps 1 to 7 inside the flow boxes\nset step numbers white bold\nline the swim lane headers up along the left edge\ninstead of headers repeat them faintly on the right too\nshow what changed to the margins\nnext put page numbers bottom right on every page\nset page numbers gray 8\npleese make the cloumns of the appendix tables match the main table\nI wonder if the index should link the terms to boxes\nmkae the cross references small superscript letters\nwhere does the todo list go? pin it top left, red\nset todo list red dashed box\nthanks, ready to print!\nCHUNK_EOF\nwc -l /home/salboaie/work/sopworlds/webmeet-dataset/imported/generated/generated-diagram.txt"
