        "content": "move my standup to 9am\npleese make the cloumns of the week view start on Monday\nset event standup 9am recurring daily\ntell me when the retro is supposed to be\ncan you show what changed on my week\nadd a dentist appointment Tuesday at half two, a haircut Thursday at five, and dinner with Ana Friday at eight\ncould you book room Atlantis for the planning session\nmake the block 90 minutes long\nthen add a 15 minute buffer after it\ninstead of daily make the standup weekdays only\nwhat if we pushed the demo to Thursday afternoon — try that\nthanks!\ndrop in a hold for lunch, noon to one, every day\nset hold lunch amber\nline the morning calls up so they do not touch\nhighest priority first: sort my Tuesday by importance, not time\nearliest first: list everything before noon\nhvae the meeting start at 9 sharp\nI wonder if Friday afternoon is still free\nwhere is the school pickup on the grid? move it to 3:15\nagain, only the Wednesday one this time\nset pickup 3:15 recurring Mon Wed Fri\nthat would help.\nbook the book club room for Thursday evening\nshield the afternoon from new meetings, I need focus time\ntell me which days look overloaded\nthen rebalance so nothing starts before 9\nnext add gym blocks on Tuesday and Thursday mornings\nset gym block 7am 45 minutes green\ncan you make the week view days 160 wide and header 40 high\nshow what changed since the gym blocks went in\nmkae the retro only an hour, not two\nwhere did my one to one with Ben go? it vanished\ninstead of a video call mark it as in person\nthen move it to the small meeting room\nthat is all; sync it.\nthanks a lot!\ncalender the team lunch for Friday, midday, whole team\nset team lunch 12:00 90 minutes\ncan you invite Ana, Ben, Chloe and Dmitri\ntell me who has not accepted yet\nwhat if we made it monthly, last Friday\nthen set a reminder three days ahead\nset reminder 3 days email\nagain no email this time, just a popup\ndrop in a birthday note on the 14th, all day\nset birthday 14th all day recurring yearly pink\nline the birthdays up in the family calendar\nI wonder if the kids half days belong on my work calendar too\npleese make the cloumns of the agenda line up with the slots\nshow what changed in June\nnext up: clear my Friday after four\nmkae the deadline loom: set the report due Friday 5pm red\nwhere does the on-call rotation show? add the schedule\nset on-call blocks navy weekly rotation\nthanks, my week finally makes sense!\nmov my dentist to friday pls\nits at 3 i think, check\nbook room 4 for the standup\nset standup 15 minutes 9am room 4\ncan you tell me where the conflict is with the ops sync\nhvae the calendar open on week view, not month\nthen hide the weekends\nagain show saturday only this time\nwhat if personal events were dimmed during work hours\nset personal dimmed 50 percent during 9 to 6\nI wonder if travel time should be blocked between sites\ndrop in a 30 minute travel block after the site visit\nset travel block dashed gray\nline the two site visits up with a real gap between them\ntell me the gap, then extend it to an hour\nthat would help a lot.\ninstead of back to back leave breathing room everywhere\nnext review my Monday: it looks brutal\nshow what changed after the shuffle\nthanks!\nset event Dentist 14:30 recurring none\ncould you find me a slot Thursday morning, 30 minutes\nwhere should the planning go? afternoon is dead\nset planning Thursday 2pm 90 minutes\nthen invite the whole squad\nhighest priority first: order the proposal reviews\nmkae the reviews 45 minutes each, not an hour\npleese make the cloumns of the monthly overview equal\nline the month numbers up in the corner of each cell\nnext dim days that are in the past\nset past days 30 percent gray\nthat is the view I wanted, thanks!\ntommorow at 10 add a sync with Elena\nset sync Elena 10am 30 minutes recurring weekly\ncan you double check the timezone, she is in Berlin\nthen show both zones on the invite\nset invite dual zone local Berlin\nwhat if it recurred every other Tuesday instead\nagain weekly this time, keep it simple\ndrop in a prep block 15 minutes before every sync\nset prep block lavender 15 minutes auto\ntell me how many prep blocks that creates per month\nI wonder if prep is even needed for a 30 minute sync\nshow what changed to my Tuesdays\nthanks, thoughtful!\nwendsday is a mess, fix it\ncould you clear everything between 12 and 2 first\nthen push the vendor call to the 3 slot\nhighest first: sort the three interviews by candidate score\nset interviews 45 minutes spaced 15 apart\nline the interviews up back to back in the morning\ninstead of three spread them across two days\nthat would help.\nmkae the lunch break sacred, block it daily\nset lunch 12:30 45 minutes deep red recurring daily\nwhere is the double booking you keep warning about\ntell me which invite clashes with the offsite\nthen decline the older one politely\nagain ask me before declining this time\nshow what changed after the decline\nnext add the offsite as all day Friday\nset offsite all day Friday location cabin\nthanks!\ncan you color code my week: work blue, family green, gym amber, admin gray\nset calendar Work blue\nset calendar Family green\nset calendar Gym amber\nset calendar Admin gray\ntell me which calendar the hairdresser ended up on\nwhat if admin tasks got a hatched pattern too\nthen legend the colors in the sidebar\nset legend sidebar compact\nagain smaller legend this time\ndrop in a swim class for the kids, Mondays at four\nset swim class 4pm 45 minutes green recurring weekly\nline the school terms up in the family calendar as all day blocks\nI wonder if half terms should be a different color\nmkae the term blocks outline only, no fill\nwhere does the inset day go? that Friday, all day\nset inset day all day gray dashed\npleese make the cloumns of the week numbers small\nthanks, the family side reads nicely!\nhvae the countdown show on the launch event\nset launch event 1 June 9am bold red\ncan you add a weekly countdown block every Monday morning\nset countdown block 15 minutes every Monday 9am\nthen title it: weeks to launch\nshow what changed since the countdown started\nnext up, schedule the rehearsal the day before\nset rehearsal 31 May 2pm full afternoon\nthat would help.\nmkae the all hands recurring monthly, first Monday\nset all hands first Monday 10am 60 minutes\nwhere should the recording link go? description, I guess\nset recording link description auto attach\nthanks!\ntueday standup keeps drifting, pin it\nset standup fixed 9:00 not floating\ncan you stop it from auto shifting around holidays\nthen add the four holidays as all day blocks\nset holidays all day red recurring yearly\nagain only the public ones this time, not the local\ndrop in a quiet hours rule, no meetings before 9 or after 5\nset quiet hours 9 to 5 enforced\ntell me who keeps booking me at 8:30\nI wonder if a gentle auto decline is too harsh\nshow what changed to my mornings\nthanks, mornings are mine again!\ndefinately add the board meeting, last Thursday monthly\nset board meeting last Thursday 2pm 120 minutes\ncan you block prep the Wednesday before each one\nset prep block Wednesday before board 90 minutes\nthen invite only the execs to the meeting itself\nhighest first: order the agenda items by impact\nline the agenda up in the invite body, numbered\ninstead of numbered keep them plain\npleese make the cloumns of the agenda table in the invite neat\nthanks, board ready!\nthat would help.\nshedule the offsite workshops: two rooms, three sessions each, breaks in between\nset workshops sessions 60 minutes breaks 20\ntell me which room fits the crowd session\nwhat if the sessions were 45 minutes to fit lunch\nthen move lunch to 12:15 sharp\nset lunch 12:15 60 minutes offsite\nagain two rooms this time, not three\ndrop in a closing circle at four in the main room\nset closing circle 4pm all rooms\nline the sessions up so nobody runs between rooms\ninstead of breaks make them longer, 30 minutes\nshow what changed to the offsite grid\nnext print the day as a one pager\nset one pager schedule only no admins\nI wonder if the facilitator names should be on each session\nmkae the session titles short, three words max\nthanks, offsite sorted!\n",
