 popup\nset snooze options 5 10 60 minutes\nline the reminder times up in the event editor\ninstead of minutes offer 5 15 30 60 only\nshow what changed to the reminder defaults\nnext silence reminders during focus blocks\nset focus silence reminders yes\nI wonder if sounds are needed at all, try silent popups\nmkae all popups silent but sticky until dismissed\nthanks, calm calendar!\nmark the marketing review as tentative until Ana confirms\nset marketing review tentative striped\ncan you hold two rooms until it is confirmed\nthen release the loser room when she decides\nagain hold the better room this time, not both\ntell me how long things usually stay tentative around here\nhighest first: sort tentative events by how stale they are\nline the tentative events up at the top of each day\ninstead of striped make tentative dashed outlines\nshow what changed to the day view\nnext nudge Ana with a gentle reminder, not a demand\nset nudge message polite 24 hours\npleese make the cloumns of the tentative list tidy\nI wonder if tentative events should count in conflict checks\nmkae them count, better a false alarm than a real clash\nthanks, nothing sneaks through now!\nthat would help before the reorg.\nhead the week with a planning block Monday 8:30, 30 minutes, sacred\nset planning block 8:30 30 minutes recurring weekly protected\ncan you top the week off with drinks Friday from five\nset drinks Friday 5pm 120 minutes social recurring\nthen keep both of those from ever being double booked\nset planning protected drinks protected\nagain let people book over drinks, it is only drinks\ntell me what other people schedule over my planning\nhighest first: list the worst offenders by count\nline the protected blocks up with a small lock icon\ninstead of a lock use a shield icon\nshow what changed to the protection rules\nnext make focus time auto schedule when a morning is free\nset focus auto 90 minutes morning underused days\nI wonder if two hours is better than 90 minutes\nmkae it two hours on Tuesdays only, 90 elsewhere\nthanks, my week has walls now!\nadd the school play as an all day banner but starting at 2 in the afternoon\nset school play 2pm banner style personal\ncan you block me traveling there from 1:30\nthen set the calendar to show me leaving quietly, no title\nset travel quiet busy 1:30 30 minutes\nagain with the title this time, in case someone asks\ndrop in a backup babysitter note in the description\nset babysitter note description private\nline the school events up in one purple line under the month\ninstead of purple make school events teal\nshow what changed to the family layer\nnext ask before moving anything on the family calendar\nset family confirm before move yes\npleese make the cloumns of the month grid equal, they are uneven\nI wonder if week numbers belong in the month view too\nmkae week numbers tiny in the left gutter\nthanks, family logistics handled!\nhvae the sprint boundaries show as thin lines across the month\nset sprint lines thin purple labeled\ncan you shift the review one day when the sprint is short\nthen keep the retro pinned to the sprint end\nagain never move planning, whatever happens\ntell me when the next three planning days are\nhighest first: rank the sprints by how loaded they look\nline the ceremonies up on a fixed weekday each sprint\ninstead of fixed weekdays anchor them to sprint days\nshow what changed to the ceremony grid\nnext add a go live deadline as a red flag, not an event\nset go live flag June 15 red flag\nI wonder if the flag should block that whole week\nmkae the week before go live amber, week of red\nthanks, sprint rhythm is clear!\nthat would help planning a lot.\nplant a recurring reminder to water the plants, Sundays, 9am\nset plant reminder Sunday 9am recurring weekly green\ncan you add a similar one for the bills on the first of the month\nset bills reminder 1st monthly 9am amber\nthen a quarterly one for the deep clean\nset deep clean quarterly first Saturday 10am\nagain monthly this time, I was optimistic\ndrop in a yearly reminder for the boiler service in autumn\nset boiler service October 1 yearly gray\nline the household reminders up under the personal calendar\ninstead of reminders make them tiny all day tasks\nshow what changed to Sunday\nnext stop the plant one for two weeks while I am away\nset plant reminder pause 2 weeks\npleese make the cloumns of the task list in side panel even\nI wonder if tiny tasks clutter the week view too much\nmkae tiny tasks dots only, expand on hover\nthanks, chores under control!\nCHUNK_EOF\nwc -l /home/salboaie/work/sopworlds/webmeet-dataset/imported/generated/generated-calendar.txt"
      }
