 externals polite 24 hours before\nagain no chase for the execs this time, I will do it\ntell me who declined without a reason, politely, privately\ndrop in a quorum note: do not meet if fewer than four accept\nset quorum rule 4 accepted\nline the attendees up: required first, optional grayed\ninstead of optional grayed make them italic\nshow what changed to the invite layout\nnext attach the agenda template to every recurring meeting\nset agenda template attach auto prefill\nI wonder if an empty agenda should cancel the meeting\nmkae meetings with empty agendas auto propose a skip\nthanks, fewer zombie meetings!\nthat would help everybody, honestly.\nmkae teh invite title say demo not demons, fix the typo\npleese fix the cloumns of the event editor, the time fields are misaligned\nits showing teh wrong week, refresh and check\ntommorow i mean the day after the holiday, account for it\nwendsday thursday whichever is free, book the review\nshedule the eye test whenever the optometrist has a slot\ncalender sync is off, my phone shows old events, investigate\ntueday morning i am driving, block it\nits at 3 i said, not 2, undo the change\nhvae the reminder fire twice, five and two minutes before\nmov the whole week forward one day, I lost my Monday\nadd buffer 10 minutes default all new meetings\nset buffer default 10 minutes amber\nthanks, typo sweep done and the defaults are kinder!\nCHUNK_EOF\nwc -l /home/salboaie/work/sopworlds/webmeet-dataset/imported/generated/generated-calendar.txt && sort /home/salboaie/work/sopworlds/webmeet-dataset/imported/generated/generated-calendar.txt | uniq -d",
