 questions template up at the top of the description\ninstead of a template attach last meeting notes\nshow what changed to my Tuesdays\nnext add a quarterly version, 90 minutes, deeper agenda\nset quarterly one to one 90 minutes amber\nI wonder if a walking one to one belongs indoors in winter\nmkae it a walking one to one from May to September only\nthanks, one to ones have a rhythm again!\nhvae the week start on Monday everywhere, the mini month too\nset week start Monday all views\ncan you check the agenda says the same timezone as the invite\nthen fix the footer of the booking page to match\nset booking footer timezone local\nthat is all for the calendar, thanks so much!\nCHUNK_EOF\nwc -l generated-calendar.txt && sort generated-calendar.txt | uniq -d | wc -l",
