ht the styles\nline the named styles up in the styles pane, alphabetical\ninstead of alphabetical sort by usage frequency\nshow what changed to the styles report\nnext save the whole set as a template called report clean\nset template report clean saved\nI wonder if the template should ship with placeholder text\nmkae the placeholder text obvious, lorem is lazy\nthanks, template is a real starting point!\nmkae teh heading say conclution then fix it to conclusion\npleese make the cloumns equaly wide in the budget table\nits supose to be twelve point not eleven, the body I mean\nhvae the intro say why now, not just why\nwritting style drifts formal to chatty around chapter four, smooth it\nthier are two blank pages before the appendix, remove them\nbeleive me the margins look different on the last page, check\nwierd spacing after every period, double spaces maybe, kill them\nmov the summary before the toc, it reads better first\nadd table contents right after title page\nset font 12 body no exceptions\nindent quote 2 from left\ndelete second row of the timeline table\nmake heading small caps not full caps\nthanks, cleanup pass done!\nthat would help before the editor sees it.\ncan you split chapter two at the case study\nthen promote the case study to a chapter of its own\nset case study chapter level 1\nagain keep it as a section this time, revert\ntell me how the page count moved after the split\nhighest first: order the chapters by how much they shrank in review\nline the new chapter transitions up, each opens with a bridge\ninstead of a bridge let two open cold, dramatic\nshow what changed to the outline\nnext update the TOC and the reading order note\nset reading order note preface updated\npleese make the cloumns of the outline view show word counts\nI wonder if the outline hides any empty sections\nmkae the empty sections visible with a placeholder dot\nthanks, structure visible at a glance!\ncould you package the final as pdf, epub and docx from one source\nset export three formats from one source\nthen name them consistently with the version number\nset file names report v1 0 consistent\nagain bump to v1 1 this time, we changed the cover\ntell me which format lost the fonts on export\ndrop in a pdf export preset: tagged, outlines off, images 300\nset pdf preset tagged fonts embedded\nline the three exports up in the delivery folder\ninstead of one folder split by recipient\nshow what changed in the delivery folder\nnext email the docx to Priya and keep the pdf for the board\nset delivery Priya docx board pdf\nI wonder if the epub passed the checker, run it again\nmkae the epub check part of the export, every time\nthanks, shipping is one click now!\nhvae the invoice table compute the vat line automatically\nset invoice vat 20 percent computed\ncan you total the columns at the bottom in bold\nthen carry the total to the summary box at the top\nset summary box total bold large\nagain round the total this time, whole numbers only\ntell me which line items lack a code\ndrop in a payment terms line under the table: net 30\nset payment terms net 30 small\nline the amounts up right aligned with the currency symbol consistent\ninstead of trailing symbol put it before, this is not a menu\nshow what changed to the invoice\nnext duplicate the invoice as a template with blanks\nset invoice template blanks no totals\npleese make the cloumns of the invoice template match the sample\nI wonder if the logo should sit left or centered\nmkae the logo left, quieter, same gray as the footer\nthanks, invoicing looks grown up!\nthat would help getting paid.\nmerge the two source docs into one report, keep the better intro\nset merge prefer doc one intro\ncan you deduplicate the references after the merge\nthen renumber the citations in the merged text\nset citations renumber sequential\nagain keep author date, no renumber this time\ntell me how many duplicates the merge created\nhighest first: list the duplicated passages by length\nline the 